# Build context for the monorepo. The agent, api, and dashboard images all
# build with `context: .` and reach across packages, so we exclude only the
# directories none of them need (operator/, sites/, docs/) plus build
# artifacts. Excluding api/ or dashboard/ here breaks their COPY steps.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.env
.git/
.vscode/
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
operator/
sites/
docs/
*.md
